{"id":"uau9eilol0bka0fm60nocwgi0","title":"药物研发为何投入增加产出不增","originalTitle":"为什么懂得更多 药物研发却未必更高效","summary":"药物研发面临高失败率和证据断层问题，新药产出与研发投入不成正比。有效策略是结合靶点驱动发现（TDD）和表型驱动发现（PDD），并通过机制知识和系统表型相互校正，提高研发效率。转化医学需建立证据链，连接未满足需求、药物作用机制和临床终点，实现精准医疗。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3662723&do=blog&id=1560829"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T01:23:44.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:09:58.312Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:09:58.312Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2c5b7f72-88f9-4e0f-acb4-a33b019b7d74","title":"药物研发绩效问题与TDD-PDD结合策略提出"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2c5b7f72-88f9-4e0f-acb4-a33b019b7d74","title":"药物研发绩效问题与TDD-PDD结合策略提出"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fK3MiIrJ8E1U","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}